# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# App/App/public, App/App/capacitor.config.json and App/App/config.xml are
# written by `npx cap sync ios` and are committed on purpose: the Mac that
# builds the app opens the project in Xcode without running Node. Run the sync
# after changing capacitor.config.json or native-shell/, and commit the result.
